                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Install the Whale wallet from https://github.com/jhonnyisaacc/whale\n\n1. Clone it and run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile && pnpm run build\n2. Start the executor in the background with a random token:\n   PORT=8788 EXECUTOR_AUTH_TOKEN=<token> pnpm run start:executor\n3. Register its MCP server (stdio: node dist/src/mcp-server.js) with\n   EXECUTOR_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8788 and the same EXECUTOR_AUTH_TOKEN,\n   and the skills in skills/, with this host.\n\nThe local MCP is dry-run only: nothing signs or broadcasts.\nThen call wallet_status and show me the result.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
