            "N2AfU": {
              "fontSize": 12,
              "lineHeight": 1.65,
              "content": "Install the Whale wallet from\nhttps://github.com/jhonnyisaacc/whale\n\n1. Clone it and run:\n   pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\n   && pnpm run build\n2. Start the executor in the\n   background with a random token:\n   PORT=8788 EXECUTOR_AUTH_TOKEN=<token>\n   pnpm run start:executor\n3. Register its MCP server\n   (stdio: node dist/src/mcp-server.js)\n   with EXECUTOR_URL=\n   http://127.0.0.1:8788 and the same\n   EXECUTOR_AUTH_TOKEN, and the skills\n   in skills/, with this host.\n\nThe local MCP is dry-run only:\nnothing signs or broadcasts.\nThen call wallet_status and show me\nthe result."
            }
          }
